.\" M4KK1 4P1 - cu.8
.TH CU 8 "2026-07-22" "M4KK1 1.0" "M4KK1 System Administration"
.SH NAME
cu \- cancel user login
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B cu
\fIusername\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
Force-logout a user: lock the account, terminate all processes owned by the user, unmount the home directory, and log the action. Requires prime group membership.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR usermod (8),
.BR who (1),
.BR quell (8)
